+### CDC
+
+Change data capture (CDC) streams inserts, updates, and deletes from the source's write-ahead log in near real time. It's available on sources that support logical replication, such as [Postgres](/docs/cdp/sources/postgres#change-data-capture-cdc), and requires database-level setup like replication slots and publications.
